#. TRANSLATORS: text
#: levels/tips/blades.tres
msgid ""
"You found a new blade. Open the inventory with {inventory} to take it up.\n"
"\n"
"You carry one blade at a time. Wearing another puts the old one away."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: title
#: levels/tips/captives.tres
msgid "Captives"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: text
#: levels/tips/captives.tres
msgid ""
"You freed a captive. More are locked in cages across the land: strike a cage until it breaks to set them free.\n"
"\n"
"Someone may want to hear of every one you save."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: text
#: levels/tips/charms.tres
msgid ""
"You found a charm. Open the inventory with {inventory} to wear it.\n"
"\n"
"Charms change your strength, speed and more. You can only wear as many as you have charm slots."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: title
#: levels/tips/death_mark.tres
msgid "Death marks"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: text
#: levels/tips/death_mark.tres
msgid ""
"Death left a mark where you last stood on safe ground. Every mark weakens you: less spirit, and less spirit and coin from your foes.\n"
"\n"
"Go back to the mark and press {interact} to take it back. It also heals you."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: title
#: levels/tips/death_marks_more.tres
msgid "Clearing marks"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: text
#: levels/tips/death_marks_more.tres
msgid ""
"Marks add up, and each one weakens you more. Up to five can wait for you at once.\n"
"\n"
"A cleanse point clears every mark at once, for a price."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: text
#: levels/tips/dumas.tres
msgid ""
"You took up a duma. Press {duma} to sing it.\n"
"\n"
"Singing costs spirit, shown under your health. Landing hits fills it back up."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: title
#: levels/tips/execution.tres
msgid "Finishers"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: text
#: levels/tips/execution.tres
msgid ""
"A beaten enemy has dropped to its knees. Stand next to it and press {interact} to finish it.\n"
"\n"
"You can't be hurt during a finisher, and it fills your spirit."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: title
#: levels/tips/healing.tres
msgid "Healing flasks"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: text
#: levels/tips/healing.tres
msgid ""
"Press {heal} to drink a healing flask. Drinking takes a moment, so find a safe one.\n"
"\n"
"Flasks fill up again whenever you rest at a rest point."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: title
#: levels/tips/parry.tres
#: ui/menus/options/controls_options.gd:30
msgid "Parry"
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: text
#: levels/tips/parry.tres
msgid ""
"Press {parry} just before a blow lands to turn it aside. Not every attack can be parried: heavy ones push you back through your guard.\n"
"\n"
"Right after a parry, press {attack} to strike back with a riposte."
msgstr ""

#. TRANSLATORS: text
#: levels/tips/relics.tres
msgid ""
"You found a relic. Relics are old tools that change how you get around.\n"
"\n"
"Open the inventory with {inventory} and wear it in a relic slot to use it."
msgstr ""

